Z||000003||RossT||06-29-2000||05:27 AM||||I bought a fiero from Mr. Fiero in Denver on May 19th. At that time he said he was driving to the state of Main the next day on the 20th.  He was going to drive his black 88gt (w/hitch) and tow a car (fiero) back to Denver with a tow dolly. He was also going to check on t-top straps and some other parts while he was in Main for me.  I think that he is good friends with the guy from <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroparts.com</A> <BR>who bought all the c&c t-top stock. Tell you the truth, I am also a little woried about him. I have his Denver phone #.  Maybee I will call.  I think his parents are at that #.<P>Ross||||reg||1
